msgid "描述符、块设备与时间戳"
msgstr "Descriptors, Block Devices, and Timestamps"

msgid "可移动块设备身份"
msgstr "Removable Block Device Identity"

msgid ""
"``/sys/class/block/<disk>/removable``、``ro`` 和 ``diskseq`` 提供 Linux 风格 "
"的可移动标志、只读状态及全局递增介质注册序号，``uevent`` 同时包含 ``DISKSEQ``。 ``BLKGETDISKSEQ`` "
"返回打开描述符持有的整盘序号，分区描述符返回其所属整盘序号。 拔出后旧描述符保留原序号。重新注册分配更大的序号。``BLKROGET`` 与 ``BLKSSZGET`` "
"分别返回真实注册的只读标志和逻辑扇区大小。"
msgstr ""
"``/sys/class/block/<disk>/removable``, ``ro``, and ``diskseq`` provide the Linux-style removable "
"flag, read-only state, and globally increasing media registration sequence; ``uevent`` also "
"includes ``DISKSEQ``. ``BLKGETDISKSEQ`` returns the whole-disk sequence held by the open "
"descriptor; partition descriptors return their parent disk's sequence. Old descriptors retain "
"their original sequence after removal. Re-registration assigns a larger sequence. ``BLKROGET`` and"
" ``BLKSSZGET`` return the actually registered read-only flag and logical sector size respectively."

msgid ""
"FAT32/exFAT 的显式挂载支持 Linux ``uid``、``gid``、``umask``、``fmask`` 和 ``dmask`` 选项。UID/GID "
"使用十进制，掩码使用八进制。完整解析成功后才提交。 显式选项决定该文件系统实例的合成所有权和模式，ext 文件系统继续使用介质上的 POSIX 元数据。共享实例已有挂载时，不同选项返回 "
"``EBUSY``。无显式选项的 现有调用继续使用原有元数据策略。"
msgstr ""
"Explicit FAT32/exFAT mounts support Linux ``uid``, ``gid``, ``umask``, ``fmask``, and ``dmask`` "
"options. UID/GID are decimal and masks octal. Changes commit only after complete parsing succeeds."
" Explicit options determine synthesized ownership and modes for that filesystem instance; ext "
"filesystems continue using on-media POSIX metadata. Different options return ``EBUSY`` if the "
"shared instance already has mounts. Existing calls without explicit options retain their original "
"metadata policy."

msgid ""
"接口语义参考 Linux 的 `块设备 ioctl <https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/block/ioctl.c>`_、 "
"`diskseq 属性 <https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/v5.16/admin-guide/abi-testing.html>`_。"
msgstr ""
"Interface semantics follow Linux `block device ioctls "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/block/ioctl.c>`_ and the `diskseq attribute "
"<https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/v5.16/admin-guide/abi-testing.html>`_."

msgid "授权与身份"
msgstr "Authorization and Identity"

msgid ""
"打开时执行 DAC，读写检查描述符访问模式，O_PATH 不能进行普通读写。 重读分区表 BLKRRPART 要求 CAP_SYS_ADMIN，不依赖旧桌面角色。 utimensat(fd, "
"NULL, times, 0) 更新该 fd 持有的 inode，改名或 unlink 不把它 重定向到另一个同名文件；O_PATH 应拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"DAC is checked at open, reads/writes check descriptor access modes, and O_PATH cannot perform "
"ordinary I/O. Rereading a partition table with BLKRRPART requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN, independently of "
"legacy desktop roles. utimensat(fd, NULL, times, 0) updates the inode held by that fd; rename or "
"unlink does not redirect it to a different file with the same name. O_PATH must be rejected."

msgid "Linux 请求值"
msgstr "Linux Request Values"

msgid ""
"BLKROGET 使用 Linux 历史 _IO(0x12,94) 编码，旧错误 _IOR 编码不作为新契约。 使用旧头固化请求值的应用需以当前 UAPI 重编译。内部 "
"timerfd/eventfd 状态 不能与 O_SYNC/O_TMPFILE 位重叠；同步操作要实际完成刷新并传播失败。 独占块打开应正确检查真实挂载冲突，不把匿名 "
"RAM/光盘挂载误认为其他设备占用。"
msgstr ""
"BLKROGET uses Linux's historical _IO(0x12,94) encoding; the old incorrect _IOR encoding is not the"
" new contract. Applications with requests fixed by old headers must be rebuilt with current UAPI. "
"Internal timerfd/eventfd state must not overlap O_SYNC/O_TMPFILE bits. Synchronization must "
"actually complete flushing and propagate failures. Exclusive block opens must check actual mount "
"conflicts correctly, without mistaking anonymous RAM/optical mounts for occupation of another "
"device."

msgid "evdev 与 epoll"
msgstr "evdev and epoll"

msgid ""
"``EPOLLET`` 的输入就绪判断包含提供者事件进度。evdev 读取者排空队列后， 下一批事件即使在再次调用 epoll 之前到达，也会产生新的 ``EPOLLIN``；无需 先由 "
"epoll 观察一次空队列。未读取且没有新输入时不重复生成边沿， ``EPOLLONESHOT`` 仍须通过 ``EPOLL_CTL_MOD`` 重新启用。对 epoll 描述符的 "
"poll/select 就绪查询与实际 ``epoll_wait`` 使用同一规则，其他事件位保持 原来的逐位判断。"
msgstr ""
"``EPOLLET`` input readiness includes provider event progress. After an evdev reader drains its "
"queue, the next batch generates a new ``EPOLLIN`` even if it arrives before epoll is called again;"
" epoll need not first observe an empty queue. Unread input without new events does not generate "
"repeated edges. ``EPOLLONESHOT`` still requires rearming with ``EPOLL_CTL_MOD``. poll/select "
"readiness queries on epoll descriptors use the same rules as ``epoll_wait``; other event bits "
"retain their existing per-bit checks."

msgid ""
"evdev 进度只取对应设备、VT 和 OFD grab 可见的事件；另一终端、键盘/鼠标 之间及独占 grab 的隐藏输入不会推进该读取者的进度。原有 ``SYN_DROPPED`` "
"溢出恢复、独立读取游标和用户事件结构不变，不以全局 poll 唤醒次数冒充 某个描述符的新输入。EPOLL 属 Linux 接口，不将其称为 POSIX 接口。"
msgstr ""
"evdev progress counts only events visible to the reader's device, VT, and OFD grab. Input on "
"another terminal or between keyboard/mouse devices, and input hidden by an exclusive grab, does "
"not advance that reader's progress. Existing ``SYN_DROPPED`` overflow recovery, independent read "
"cursors, and user event structures remain unchanged. Global poll wakeup counts must not masquerade"
" as new input on a particular descriptor. EPOLL is a Linux interface and must not be called a "
"POSIX interface."

msgid "ppoll 与信号掩码"
msgstr "ppoll and Signal Masks"

msgid ""
"``ppoll`` 接受可选的 64 位临时信号掩码；原始系统调用的第五个参数在掩码非空时 必须为 8 字节。等待期间使用临时掩码，``SIGKILL`` 与 ``SIGSTOP`` "
"始终不可屏蔽。 就绪、超时或最终错误返回时恢复原掩码；调度重试和交换页等待保留调用拥有的状态， 取消调用时释放并恢复。信号中断返回 ``EINTR``，信号帧保存进入 ``ppoll`` "
"前的掩码， 由 ``rt_sigreturn`` 恢复，``SA_RESTART`` 不自动重启这个等待。"
msgstr ""
"``ppoll`` accepts an optional temporary 64-bit signal mask; when non-NULL, the raw syscall's fifth"
" argument must be 8 bytes. The temporary mask applies while waiting, with ``SIGKILL`` and "
"``SIGSTOP`` always unmaskable. Readiness, timeout, or final-error returns restore the original "
"mask. Scheduler retries and swap-page waits retain call-owned state; cancellation releases it and "
"restores the mask. Signal interruption returns ``EINTR``; the signal frame saves the pre-``ppoll``"
" mask for ``rt_sigreturn`` to restore. ``SA_RESTART`` does not automatically restart this wait."

msgid ""
"非空掩码不再返回 ``EOPNOTSUPP``，支持 OpenSSH 等程序在事件循环中临时解除信号屏蔽。 超时仍向上换算为毫秒并按调度 tick 等待；这不表示已经实现高精度纳秒定时。"
msgstr ""
"Non-NULL masks no longer return ``EOPNOTSUPP``, allowing programs such as OpenSSH to temporarily "
"unblock signals in event loops. Timeouts still round up to milliseconds and wait in scheduler "
"ticks; this does not imply high-resolution nanosecond timers."

msgid "流接收与进程目录"
msgstr "Stream Reception and Process Directories"

msgid ""
"TCP 的 ``recvfrom/recvmsg`` 支持 ``MSG_PEEK``：重复预读保留相同的未读字节， "
"不前移接收游标，也不为尚未消费的数据重新通告接收窗口。``MSG_DONTWAIT`` 只影响当前调用，不修改共享 OFD 的 ``O_NONBLOCK``。无数据时返回 ``EAGAIN``， "
"有序关闭且队列排空时返回零。未实现的 TCP 接收标志，包括 ``MSG_WAITALL``、 ``MSG_OOB`` 与 ``MSG_TRUNC``，明确返回 "
"``EOPNOTSUPP``；不能静默消耗数据 或把短读冒充所请求的完整语义。UDP、packet 和 UNIX 的标志支持由各协议处理。 标志定义参见 `POSIX socket 头文件 "
"<https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799.2024edition/basedefs/sys_socket.h.html>`_。"
msgstr ""
"TCP ``recvfrom/recvmsg`` supports ``MSG_PEEK``: repeated peeks retain the same unread bytes "
"without advancing the receive cursor or readvertising the receive window for unconsumed data. "
"``MSG_DONTWAIT`` affects only the current call, not the shared OFD's ``O_NONBLOCK``. No data "
"returns ``EAGAIN``; orderly shutdown with an empty queue returns zero. Unimplemented TCP receive "
"flags, including ``MSG_WAITALL``, ``MSG_OOB``, and ``MSG_TRUNC``, explicitly return ``EOPNOTSUPP``"
" rather than silently consuming data or presenting short reads as the requested full semantics. "
"UDP, packet, and UNIX handle flags per protocol. See the `POSIX socket header "
"<https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799.2024edition/basedefs/sys_socket.h.html>`_ for "
"flag definitions."

msgid ""
"``/proc`` 数字进程目录的枚举 cookie 按 PID 递增，独立于调度器内部数组下标。 一个进程退出并触发数组压缩，不应导致仍存活的较大 PID 从同一次枚举中丢失。 达到最大 PID"
" 后保留 64 位 EOF cookie，重新查找从零开始，不回绕到固定目录项。"
msgstr ""
"Enumeration cookies for numeric process directories in ``/proc`` increase by PID, independently of"
" scheduler array indices. Process exit and array compaction must not cause a surviving higher PID "
"to disappear from the same enumeration. A 64-bit EOF cookie is retained after the maximum PID; a "
"fresh lookup starts at zero without wrapping to fixed directory entries."

msgid "挂载视图"
msgstr "Mount Views"

msgid ""
"``/proc/self/mounts`` 与 ``/proc/self/mountinfo`` 从实际挂载图生成，反映 ``MS_MOVE`` "
"后的位置和父挂载关系。可见父挂载先于其子挂载输出；移动旧挂载 到较新挂载之下时也保持此顺序，不能以 mount ID 的大小推断父子关系。 设备 major/minor 与同一挂载内 "
"``stat.st_dev`` 的编码一致。"
msgstr ""
"``/proc/self/mounts`` and ``/proc/self/mountinfo`` derive from the actual mount graph, reflecting "
"positions and parent relationships after ``MS_MOVE``. Visible parent mounts precede children even "
"when an old mount moves beneath a newer one; mount ID order does not determine parentage. Device "
"major/minor encoding agrees with ``stat.st_dev`` within the same mount."

msgid ""
"初始根挂载与 ``mount(2)`` 的默认访问时间策略一致：未显式选择策略时采用 ``relatime``。这包括直接挂载的物理根、安装器与 live 的内存块根，以及 早期用户态的初始 "
"tmpfs 根。明确指定 ``MS_NOATIME`` 或 ``MS_STRICTATIME`` 时保留该选择；同时出现时 ``MS_STRICTATIME`` 优先。该默认值只作用于根的 "
"挂载实例，保留底层强制只读及既有其他标志，不修改共享卷、ESP 或光盘等 其他挂载角色的策略。"
msgstr ""
"The initial root mount follows the default access-time policy of ``mount(2)``: ``relatime`` unless"
" a policy is explicit. This includes directly mounted physical roots, installer/live memory-block "
"roots, and the initial tmpfs root in early userspace. Explicit ``MS_NOATIME`` or "
"``MS_STRICTATIME`` is preserved; ``MS_STRICTATIME`` wins if both occur. The default applies only "
"to the root mount instance, preserving underlying forced read-only and other existing flags; it "
"does not change policies for shared volumes, ESPs, optical media, or other mount roles."

msgid ""
"查看根之外的挂载根不出现在 chroot 视图中；可见记录保留实际 ID，因此其 parent ID 可能位于查看范围之外。路径字段转义空格、制表符、换行和反斜线。 "
"分段读取使用同一图顺序和字节偏移，不依赖反向插入的内部链表布局。"
msgstr ""
"Mount roots outside the viewing root do not appear in chroot views. Visible records retain actual "
"IDs, so their parent IDs may lie outside the view. Path fields escape spaces, tabs, newlines, and "
"backslashes. Fragmented reads use the same graph order and byte offsets, independently of reverse-"
"insertion internal list layout."
